            "review_text": "Oscardog16\nAdelaide, Australia3348 contributions\n0\nFabulous pork knuckle\nSep 2025 • Couples\nOne night we ate at the restaurant and ordered delivery on a second night. Both knuckles were delicious and had crispy skin all around. We couldn’t finish the meal between 2 adults. The remaining meat was packaged for us to takeaway with a tub of gravy and one with mustard. We highly recommend this restaurant and factor in a 45-minute wait for the pork to be cooked.\nRead more\nWritten September 17, 2025",
